Name:Rules pilot 449 - Intimidate lets artifacts block
Goal:Win
Turns:1
Difficulty:Medium
Description:It is your first main phase. You control Bladetusk Boar (3/2 red, intimidate) and have Shock in hand with one red mana floating. The opponent is at 3 life and controls an untapped Ornithopter (0/2 artifact) and an untapped Grizzly Bears. Reduce the opponent to 0 life this turn.
Rule:authored-intimidate-artifact-blocker | A creature with intimidate can be blocked only by artifact creatures and creatures that share a color with it (CR 702.13b): Shock the Ornithopter and the green Bears can't block the Boar, which deals 3; Shocking the Bears leaves the artifact Ornithopter free to block, and Shock to the face deals only 2
